   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "营造更温馨的气氛",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/19141",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=19141",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"19141\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "想为漫长的午餐和惬意的晚餐打造舒适宜人的用餐空间？这张白色桌子和桦木椅子会是不错的入手点，它们能为不同概念和设计风格的餐吧增添一抹木材的温暖气息和经典风格。增添点晴之笔？那就调暗灯光，营造更亲密的氛围。",
    "营造更温馨的气氛"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3a620beadc99ccb8/original/PH183198.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/19141",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3a620beadc99ccb8/original/PH183198.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "餐吧墙边有一张白色的TOMMARYD 托玛瑞德 桌子和四张桦木椅子，上方挂着一盏吊灯，桌面放着几盘食物。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/3a620beadc99ccb8/original/PH183198.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
   "productIds": [],
   "settings": {
    "traceId": "f82ea0a6149447caae448b1e19bfad9c"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "坐在高凳上享用午餐",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/54966",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=54966",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"54966\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "这些桌子和高脚吧台凳可以助你布置一个适合休闲午餐、快速会议和晚上聚会的场所；这些桌椅易于移动，人多的时候也能灵活调整。浅色木材别具优雅的温暖感，可营造舒适的休闲氛围。",
    "坐在高凳上享用午餐"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/1dfa785d63eaff86/original/PH183208.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/54966",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/1dfa785d63eaff86/original/PH183208.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "五张桦木RÖNNINGE 瑞宁 吧台凳围绕着两张吧台摆放，吧台上放着杯子装的酒和水，旁边有一个大窗户。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/1dfa785d63eaff86/original/PH183208.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
